<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S5.SS0.SSS0.P2" title="In 5 Does RFT Yield Generalization Across Different Environments? ‣ Can RL Improve Generalization of LLM Agents? An Empirical Study" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">5.0.0.2 </span>Performance differs significantly between held-in and held-out environments.</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S5.SS0.SSS0.P3" title="In 5 Does RFT Yield Generalization Across Different Environments? ‣ Can RL Improve Generalization of LLM Agents? An Empirical Study" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">5.0.0.3 </span>In unseen environments, positive transfer is observed in most cases.</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S5.SS0.SSS0.P4" title="In 5 Does RFT Yield Generalization Across Different Environments? ‣ Can RL Improve Generalization of LLM Agents? An Empirical Study" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">5.0.0.4 </span>In unseen environments, negative effects may sometimes occur.</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S5.SS0.SSS0.P5" title="In 5 Does RFT Yield Generalization Across Different Environments? ‣ Can RL Improve Generalization of LLM Agents? An Empirical Study" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">5.0.0.5 </span>Cross-environment generalization performance varies significantly across target environments.</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
